      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/34/1/55/7",
      "text": [
        " قَالَ عَلِيُّ بْنُ اَلْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِمَا اَلسَّلاَمُ :\nفِي مُكَاتَبَةٍ يَطَؤُهَا مَوْلاَهَا فَتَحْبَلُ قَالَ \"يَرُدُّ عَلَيْهَا مَهْرَ مِثْلِهَا وَ تَسْعَى فِي قِيمَتِهَا فَإِنْ عَجَزَتْ فَهِيَ مِنْ أُمَّهَاتِ اَلْأَوْلاَدِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3563 - Al-Sakuni narrated from Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) from his father, Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as) (peace be upon them), who said:\n\"Imam Ali ibn Al-Hussain (as) was asked about a contract-bound female slave (mukatabah) whose master had intercourse with her, and she became pregnant.\nImam (as) replied: \"He must pay her the equivalent of her dowry, and she must work to pay off her value. If she is unable to do so, then she is considered one of the mothers of children (Umm al-Walad).\""
        ]
      }
    },
